#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use IBM Cloud Identity Access Management (IAM) to manage users with or without an IBM Cloud account"
msgstr "Verwende IBM Cloud Identity Access Management (IAM), um Benutzer mit oder ohne IBM Cloud-Konto zu verwalten"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage ID provider users"
msgstr "ID-Provider-Benutzer verwalten"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage ID provider users {#manage-id-provider-users}"
msgstr "ID-Provider-Benutzer verwalten {#manage-id-provider-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can integrate with your external identity provider (IDP) to securely authenticate external users to your IBM Cloud account. By using an external provider, you can provide a way for users in your company to use single sign-on (SSO). You can connect your cloud account to an external IDP one of the following ways:\n"
msgstr "Du kannst dich mit deinem externen Identitätsprovider (IDP) integrieren, um externe Benutzer sicher bei deinem IBM Cloud-Konto zu authentifizieren. Durch die Verwendung eines externen Providers kannst du Benutzern in deinem Unternehmen die Möglichkeit geben, Single Sign-on (SSO) zu nutzen. Du kannst dein Cloud-Konto auf eine der folgenden Arten mit einem externen IDP verbinden:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [IBM Cloud&reg; SAML service provider (SP)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-cloud-saml)\n"
msgstr "Verwende den [IBM Cloud&reg; SAML Service Provider (SP)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-cloud-saml)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use [App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-appid) (might incur a cost)\n"
msgstr "Verwende [App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-appid) (kann Kosten verursachen)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Federate your users to all IBM&reg; products with IBMid](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-ibmid)\n"
msgstr "[Verbinde deine Benutzer mit IBMid für alle IBM&reg;-Produkte](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-ibmid)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"After connecting your IDP, you can set up dynamic rules so you don't have to manually add every user to every group when they join.  See [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#app-id-dynamic-rules) for instructions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Nachdem du deinen IDP verbunden hast, kannst du dynamische Regeln einrichten, sodass du nicht jeden Benutzer manuell zu jeder Gruppe hinzufügen musst, wenn er beitritt. Anweisungen dazu findest du unter [Authentifizierung über einen externen Identitätsprovider aktivieren](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#app-id-dynamic-rules).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Nächste Schritte {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   * Refer to the [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration) topic.\n"
"   * See [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) for more information.\n"
"   * Refer to the full [App ID documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Empfehlungen\">\n"
"   * Lies das Thema [Authentifizierung über einen externen Identitätsprovider aktivieren](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration).\n"
"   * Weitere Informationen findest du im [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide).\n"
"   * Lies die vollständige [App ID-Dokumentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
